WEBVTT

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.110
Ready, and...

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.860
What are you doing, Aoi?

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.310
T-Training.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.350
Honestly... Don't overdo it.

00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:44.620
Okay.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:48.620
I'll stick to just one today.

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.870
<i>Winter is approaching.</i>

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:56.530
<i>I'm training to improve my 
stamina, little by little,</i>

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:58.080
Mt. Tenran

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:02.680
<i>so that I can take on Mt. 
Fuji again next summer.</i>

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:08.190
<b>It's a Secret</b>

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:10.730
Aoi-san?

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:13.420
Hey, Kokona-chan.

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:16.070
I came to meet the squirrels, but...

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.890
I wonder if they're hibernating.

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:20.830
It's November already, after all.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:22.070
Yes.

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:25.270
Speaking of November, what 
should we do for celebrations?

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:26.330
Celebrations?

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.670
Was there something worth celebrating?

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:31.210
It's Hinata-san's birthday.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:33.300
Oh, right, the 11th!

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:34.120
Next week!

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:34.810
Yes!

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:37.840
We celebrated mine at Mt. Tanigawa.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.090
We should do Hinata-san's, too.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.340
Yeah, you're right.

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:44.850
A surprise party?

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.720
Of course I'm in.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:49.780
Kokona-chan's going to bake us snacks.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:52.230
I'm thinking of ordering a cake from Susuki.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.540
<i>Now we just need a present.</i>

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.980
Yeah. Why don't we all pick one out together?

00:02:57.180 --> 00:02:58.370
That sounds great!

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:00.490
How about tomorrow, then?

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.620
Let's meet up after school. 
I'll be with Kokona-chan at the station—

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.490
Tomorrow?

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:06.490
Kaede-san?

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:10.550
You said you'd work on 
this workbook tomorrow!

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:12.300
I-I can do it the day after...

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:13.130
No!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.720
You haven't even finished yesterday's!

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.130
<i>What's wrong, Kaede-san?</i>

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.020
<i>Sorry, I'll leave it to you.</i>

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:21.580
Huh?

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:22.930
<i>You can choose a gift.</i>

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:23.490
What?!

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:26.430
<i>Don't worry, you're her best friend.</i>

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.190
<i>Bye.</i>

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.140
Kaede-san

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:30.140
Kaede-san! Kaede-san!

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.090
Best friend?

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:33.650
She's right.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:37.730
You're the one who knows Hinata-san best.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:40.050
I'll leave it to you.

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.110
You're metaphysically linked.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.160
How wonderful.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.260
No, wait...

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:48.530
I can just imagine Hinata-san 
jumping with joy.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:51.700
I-I'll take care of it.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.590
How would I know? I'm not a telepath!

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:57.910
Jeez.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.590
What should I get her?

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:04.190
She has a mountain coffee mug.

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:07.350
She's already got a lot 
of mountain climbing gear.

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.750
What else would Hinata want?

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:13.350
What would she...

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:15.840
What would she...

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:20.880
Oh, yeah! I wanted that new bead color!

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.360
Wait, that's what <i>I</i> want!

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:29.900
I actually don't know her as well as I thought.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:35.370
<i>All right, I'll have to ask her casually.</i>

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:35.370
Man, it's chilly this morning.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:36.950
<i>Casually.</i>

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.990
<i>"Do you have any hobbies?"</i>

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.380
<i>"What are you interested in right now?"</i>

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:44.710
<i>Unnoticeably. Naturally. Informally.</i>

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.810
H-Hinata!

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:50.600
I-Is there anything you're addicted to?

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.100
<i>That wasn't casual at all.</i>

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.100
Excellent question!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.410
My dad bought a massage chair.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:04:59.900
I'm hooked on it!

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:03.050
You should try it out when you come over.

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.900
<i>I forgot she was kind of an old fogey.</i>

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.160
<i>I guess it doesn't have 
to be an item, though.</i>

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.160
Supreme moment of relaxation to heal your weary soul

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:10.660
So expensive! I can't afford that.

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:13.220
If I get her something within my budget...

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.790
<b>Shoulder massage voucher</b>

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:16.270
A shoulder massage vouchers?

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:19.130
I could add helping vouchers...

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.170
One-day helping voucher

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.170
Cleaning | Laundry | Garbage | Bathroom cleaning

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.920
What is this, Mother's Day?

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:24.330
Jeez, Hinata, what do you want me to do?

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:26.180
Would you really want one?

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.700
Little sisters are nothing but noisy.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.550
It's nice having a sister, though.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:33.580
I wish I had a sister instead of a brother.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.310
I know what you mean.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.560
I wish I had a kid sister, too.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.090
<i>She wants a kid sister?</i>

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:40.060
<i>All right...</i>

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.320
One-day Kid Sister Voucher

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.190
<i>A one-day kid sister voucher!</i>

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.970
Here, Hinata-oneechan! Have a youkan!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.030
Rice crackers!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.320
Hojicha!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.390
Thank you, everyone.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.330
This is just Seniors' Day!

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:54.900
Calm down, me!

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:56.940
Stupid! Stupid!

00:05:58.350 --> 00:05:59.840
<b>Hanasaika Susuki</b>

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.840
<b>Hanasaika Susuki</b>

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.840
November 5th

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.840
Yusuke-kun

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:01.840
Okay, for the 11th.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:04.460
You can come pick it up on the day.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.060
Thank you.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.910
It's for Hinata-chan's birthday celebration.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:10.090
Do your best for her, please, boss.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.100
You can count on me.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:14.200
I've been thinking of making 
something a little special.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.600
Like what?

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.410
It's gorgeous!

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:19.990
Th-That's so much...

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:22.920
Don't worry. I'll make it within budget.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.940
Hinata-chan will love it!

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:28.700
Th-Thank you.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:32.720
That'll make her happy for sure.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:38.440
Maybe Kokona-chan's snacks 
and that cake will be enough.

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:51.340
Aoi, hurry up.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.810
You'll be late.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.350
Coming.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.890
Hey, don't sigh.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:01.850
But...

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:04.130
You're a high schooler starting today.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:06.110
You need to deal with your fear of strangers.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:08.060
Come on, chin up.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.490
Congratulations
New Students

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.280
We're together!

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:18.750
The same class!

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:20.380
I'm so glad!

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:22.380
This is great!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.250
Jeez, seriously.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.690
Sorry.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:31.930
Entrance Ceremony

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.150
<i>I'm not good at socializing,</i>

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:41.360
<i>so I thought I could just enjoy
high school by myself.</i>

00:07:57.050 --> 00:08:01.810
<i>The seasons have passed, and 
I've made lots of memories.</i>

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:05.880
<i>Beautiful memories, beautiful scenes...</i>

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:09.060
<i>Things I would have never found by myself.</i>

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:13.010
<i>But is there...</i>

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.660
<i>Is there nothing I can 
do for Hinata in return?</i>

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.580
Hey!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.400
Aoi!

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.280
Aoi! You've been weird lately.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.530
Have I?

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:39.540
You talk to yourself a lot, and you're 
not paying attention in class.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.160
You think so?

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.750
You are. You're being weird.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.290
Not that you haven't always been a bit spacey.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.320
I know I am.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.290
You can talk to me if there's 
something on your mind.

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:54.280
Are you worried that you've 
gained weight lately?

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:56.460
You shouldn't eat too much.

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:57.710
Boys won't like you.

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:59.560
I'm not fat!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.240
I don't eat that much, either!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.850
Jeez, you have no idea how I feel right now!

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.640
That's why I'm asking.

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:07.810
You have to tell me, or I won't know.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:11.150
I was trying to figure out 
how to make you happy!

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.070
Me? Why?

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.030
For your surprise birthday party!

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:20.530
I've been thinking this whole time about 
what to get you, and I've got nothing!

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:21.840
And...

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:27.040
Wh-What's so funny?

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:29.820
It's a surprise, isn't it?

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:31.970
You're not supposed to tell me!

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.350
<i>Shoot!</i>

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.260
Thanks, though.

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.080
I'm really happy.

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:48.810
Why are you sighing?

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:52.820
I just realized I don't 
know anything about you.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.170
That's normal.

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:56.500
Is it?

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:59.610
It's not like I know everything 
about you, either.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:01.290
But you know...

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:04.330
That's what makes it fun, right?

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.680
Fun?

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:06.480
Yeah.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.510
You don't know, so you try to learn.

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:11.220
You want to learn, so it's fun hanging out.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:15.180
I think it's fun to get to know each other.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:16.510
To know each other?

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.160
Yeah.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:21.470
I think we want to stay friends 
because we're having fun.

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:28.210
Yeah... I guess so.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:30.900
All right...

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:34.180
I'll tell you something you don't know.

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:36.890
I haven't told anyone yet,

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.160
but these days, I...

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.590
Seriously?!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:49.980
Come on, tell me something I don't know, too.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.670
Um, then...

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:55.400
I'm actually...

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:57.420
No!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.340
Don't, don't, don't!

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.490
You surprise me, Aoi.

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:04.940
Same goes for you.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:10.940
<i>That's right.</i>

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.540
<i>I wasn't by myself.</i>

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.730
<i>We found it together.</i>

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:19.210
<i>All the happy memories and 
the beautiful scenery.</i>

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.740
All right, let's go buy it, then.

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.160
Buy what?

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:28.460
There's a cute makeup 
bag at Tokorozawa Seibu.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:30.520
I've been wanting it.

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:32.440
We're going now, though?

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:33.000
Yeah.

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:35.250
They say, "Haste makes waste," don't they?

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.260
Don't you mean, 
"There's no time like the present"?

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.320
What's the difference?

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:42.860
The point is, let's hurry!

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:50.070
A makeup bag, though? 
Do you even wear makeup?

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:52.330
We're in high school. Of course I do.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.620
No way! I've never seen you wear any!

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:59.170
I don't expect a child like you to
know what grown-up makeup is.

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:02.910
Jeez, don't make fun of me, Hinata!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.620
Little girl!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.820
I'm not a little girl!

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.870
<b>Hinata-chan</b>

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:13.500
<i>H-Happy birthday, Hinata-chan.</i>

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.830
<i>Let's go mountain climbing and stuff again.</i>

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:18.460
<i>R-Ready, and...</i>

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.380
Happy birthday!

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.960
Thanks, everyone.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.350
<i>What are you looking at?!</i>

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:29.110
<i>Happy birthday, Hinata-chan! Woo!</i>

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:05.690
<i>Pretty soon, fall will end, 
and winter will be here.</i>

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:09.680
<i>Even if the seasons pass 
and the scenery changes,</i>

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:12.460
<i>we'll keep making memories.</i>

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.820
<i>Lots more memories, from now on.</i>

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:19.610
<i>Unseen scenery, together, forever.</i>

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:24.810
<i>The changing seasons, together.</i>

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.770
See you again!
